OL,3,GNEWSADebt-ridden council announces
OL,4,A#51.2m more savings
OL,5,
OL,6,FCash-strapped Warrington Borough
OL,7,FCouncil is planning more than #50m of
OL,8,Fextra cuts.
OL,10,FIt is set to publish a report detailing
OL,11,Fa further #51.2m of savings which,
OL,12,Falongside #39m of cuts previously
OL,13,Fidentified by the authority in March,
OL,14,Fbrings the total to about #90m.
OL,16,FThis included ending funding for
OL,17,Fwalking day, selling off assets,
OL,18,Fcutting street lighting and stopping
OL,19,Ffree parking in the town centre.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
