OL,3,GNEWSADebt-ridden council announces
OL,4,A#51.2m more savings
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Labour administration said the cuts
OL,7,Fwere aimed at "ensuring the council's
OL,8,Ffuture sustainability", but the Liberal
OL,9,FDemocrats said there was "little
OL,10,Fconfidence" in the administration.
